<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich Cant'l Bank cuts cash bond rates 1/4 point.</title>
<headline>Zurich Cant'l Bank cuts cash bond rates 1/4 point.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Cantonal Bank said it was cutting its cash bond rates by 1/4 point, effective tomorrow.</p>
<p>The new rates are:</p>
<p>    three years     2.00 pct</p>
<p>    four years	2.25 pct</p>
<p>    five years	2.50 pct</p>
<p>    six years	 2.75 pct</p>
<p>    seven years     3.00 pct</p>
<p>    eight years     3.25 pct</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
